---
// Shared 404 body: the middle section of the 404 page. Used by the
// standalone 404 page and by the [locale] homepage when the locale in the
// URL is not a real locale.
---
<section class="flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center px-4 py-24">
    <p class="text-7xl font-bold text-blue-600">404</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold">Page not found</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-gray-500">Страница не найдена — возможно, адрес набран с ошибкой.</p>
    <a href="/" class="mt-8 px-6 py-3 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-700">Back to homepage</a>
</section>
